      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Senior Programmer : Developed core features using advanced programming
        patterns and principles, including MVP, my custom MVPR (a modular UI management
        technique), Object Pooling for efficient memory use, Singleton for global
        state management, and Observer for event-driven behavior. Emphasized "composition
        over inheritance" for flexible and maintainable code. Also optimized code
        with LINQ for efficient data querying and manipulation, ensuring high performance
        across the application.'
